{
  "info": {
    "name": "TrainConcierge API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the AI-Powered Autonomous Train Disruption Concierge & Smart Seat Alert System.\n\n## Quick Setup\n1. Import this collection into Postman.\n2. Create an Environment with the following variables:\n   - `baseUrl` = `http://localhost:8080`\n   - `adminToken` (auto-filled by 'Login' requests)\n   - `userToken`  (auto-filled by 'Login' requests)\n   - `scheduleId` (fill after creating a schedule)\n   - `journeyId`  (fill after creating a booking)\n   - `disruptionId` (fill after triggering disruption)\n3. Run **01 Auth / Admin Login** first to populate `adminToken`.\n4. Run **01 Auth / User Register + Login** to populate `userToken`.\n\n## Notes\n- All SIMULATED endpoints never contact a real railway / hotel / cab provider.\n- Swagger UI: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html\n- OpenAPI JSON: http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "trainconcierge-v1-complete"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "01 — Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register User",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 201) { var data = pm.response.json().data; pm.environment.set('userToken', data.token); }"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","auth","register"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Test\",\n  \"lastName\": \"User\",\n  \"email\": \"testuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@2026!\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (User)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 200) { var data = pm.response.json().data; pm.environment.set('userToken', data.token); }"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","auth","login"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"testuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test@2026!\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["if (pm.response.code === 200) { var data = pm.response.json().data; pm.environment.set('adminToken', data.token); }"], "type": "text/javascript" } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","auth","login"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@2026!\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","auth","me"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "02 — Trains (Public)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List All Trains",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/trains?page=0&size=10&sortBy=trainNumber&sortDir=asc", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","trains"], "query": [{"key":"page","value":"0"},{"key":"size","value":"10"},{"key":"sortBy","value":"trainNumber"},{"key":"sortDir","value":"asc"}] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Train by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/trains/1", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","trains","1"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Trains by Route and Date",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/trains/search?originStation=Mumbai&destinationStation=Delhi&journeyDate=2026-12-01", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","trains","search"], "query": [{"key":"originStation","value":"Mumbai"},{"key":"destinationStation","value":"Delhi"},{"key":"journeyDate","value":"2026-12-01"}] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },

